Here is the root cause:
The bug was caused by improper handling of concurrent modifications to the HRC status calculation cache, which led to the Express Upgrade process getting stuck at a manual prompt. This was due to the lack of appropriate locking mechanisms around critical database operations that modify the cache, allowing multiple threads to access and modify the cache simultaneously without synchronization.

